  "hard_rules": [
    "wow-store depends only on wow-core",
    "store executes registered bounded operations and never caller SQL callbacks PRAGMAs tables extensions or UDFs",
    "all domain writes for one publication use one staging generation transaction",
    "commit checkpoint close seal and read-only validation precede head CAS",
    "published generations are immutable",
    "one coherent head replaces separate project and graph current pointers",
    "head updates use exact compare-and-swap and never silently rebase",
    "read handles bind one exact generation lease and never follow a new head",
    "recovery classifies and revalidates but never edits sealed generations",
    "retention is root based and age alone never authorizes deletion",
    "object GC follows retained generation reference manifests",
    "logical and physical determinism are reported separately",
    "no arbitrary filesystem database network process editor client source execution or CI"
  ],
